        <p pos="00001">
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-1a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.814Z">All things flow into form,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-1a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.824Z">How do they achieve completion?</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-1a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.824Z">Flowing into form and constituting bodies,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-1a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.824Z">How do they avoid death?</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-1a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.824Z">Once completed, once born,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-1a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.824Z">How do they become few and cry out?</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-1a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.824Z">Once rooted, once fundamental,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-1a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.824Z">1　How do they come after and how do they come first?</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-1a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.825Z">The positions of Yīn and Yáng,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-1a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.825Z">How do they become stable?</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-1a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.825Z">The harmony of water and fire,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-1a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.825Z">How do they avoid danger?</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-2a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.825Z">It is asked:</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-2a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.825Z">People flow into form,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-2a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.825Z">How do they achieve life?</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-2a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.825Z">2　 【 】Flowing into form and constituting bodies,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-2a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.825Z">How do they lose and die?</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-2a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.825Z">There is achievement and completion,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-2a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.825Z">Not knowing the circumstances of left and right,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-2a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.825Z">Heaven and Earth establish end and beginning:</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-2a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.826Z">Heaven bestows the five measures,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-2a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.826Z">3　How do I balance and how do I align?</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-3a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.826Z">The five Qì arrive together,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-3a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.826Z">How do I distinguish and how do I unify?</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-3a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.826Z">The five words reside in people,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-3a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.826Z">Who makes them just?</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-3a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.826Z">The nine emerge,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-3a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.826Z">Who sets their boundaries?</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-3a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.826Z">4　I have grown and 【 】perhaps aged,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-3a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.826Z">Who makes offerings?</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-3a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.826Z">Ghosts are born from people,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-3a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.826Z">Why then are they divine and luminous?</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-4a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.826Z">When flesh and bones have decayed,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-4a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.826Z">Their wisdom becomes more evident,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-4a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.826Z">Where does their essence go,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-4a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.827Z">5　Who knows 【 】 their boundaries?</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-4a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.827Z">Ghosts are born from people,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-4a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.827Z">Why then do I serve them?</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-4a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.827Z">When flesh and bones have decayed,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-4a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.827Z">The body is no longer seen,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-4a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.827Z">How do I feed myself?</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-4a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.827Z">They come without measure,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-4a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.827Z">6　 【 】How do I time them?</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-5a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.827Z">What offerings are presented?</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-5a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.827Z">How do I make them full?</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-5a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.827Z">Following the way of Heaven,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-5a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.827Z">What should I take as foremost?</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-5a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.827Z">7　I wish to obtain 【 】 the harmony of the hundred clans,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-5a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.827Z">How should I serve it?</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-5a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.828Z">How to attain reverence for Heaven's brightness?</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-5a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.828Z">What do the spirits of ghosts eat?</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-5a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.828Z">How were the wisdom of the former kings complete?</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-6a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.828Z">It is heard:</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-6a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.828Z">8　Ascend 【 】 high from low,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-6a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.828Z">.　 Reach far from near</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-6a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.828Z">A tree of ten arm-spans,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-6a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.828Z">.　 Begins life as a sprout</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-6a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.828Z">Feet that will travel a thousand lǐ,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-6a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.828Z">.　 Must start from an inch</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-6a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.828Z">9　When the sun has 【 】 a corona,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-6a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.828Z">What will it heed?</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-6a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.829Z">When the moon has a halo,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-6a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.829Z">What will it correct?</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-6a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.829Z">Water flowing east,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-6a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.829Z">What will it fill?</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-7a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.829Z">At the sun's first emergence,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-7a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.829Z">Why is it large and not [fading]?</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-7a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.829Z">10　When it enters 【 】 midday,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-7a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.829Z">Why is it small</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-7a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.829Z">Fēng Zhāng punished?</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-7a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.829Z">Ask, which is higher, Heaven,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-7a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.829Z">Or which is farther, Earth?</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-7a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.829Z">What constitutes Heaven?</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-7a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.829Z">What constitutes Earth?</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-7a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.829Z">11　What constitutes thunder 【 】 spirits?</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-7a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.829Z">What constitutes the Dì?</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-8a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.829Z">How does earth become level?</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-8a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.83Z">How does water become clear?</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-8a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.83Z">How do plants and trees come to life?</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-8a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.83Z">12A　 【 】How do birds and beasts come to cry?</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-8a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.83Z">13B　 【 】When the rain arrives,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-8a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.83Z">Who spits the moisture?</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-8a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.83Z">When the wind arrives,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-8a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.83Z">Who exhales and inhales to propel it?</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-9a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.83Z">It is heard:</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-9a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.83Z">Understand the Dào,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-9a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.83Z">.　 Sit without leaving the mat</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-9a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.83Z">14　Compose 【 】 writings,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-9a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.83Z">Without engaging in affairs,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-9a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.83Z">Know the four seas beforehand,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-9a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.83Z">Hear to a thousand lǐ,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-9a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.83Z">.　 See through to a hundred lǐ</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-9a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.831Z">Therefore, the shèngrén resides in their place,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-9a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.831Z">16　And the safety 【 】 of states and families</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-9a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.831Z">Their survival or demise,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-9a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.831Z">The rise of thieves and robbers,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-9a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.831Z">.　 Can be known in advance</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-10a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.831Z">It is heard:</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-10a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.831Z">If the heart cannot overcome the heart,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-10a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.831Z">Then six disorders arise;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-10a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.831Z">If the heart can overcome the heart,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-10a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.831Z">26.　 【 】This is called minor clarity</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-10a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.831Z">What is minor clarity?</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-10a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.831Z">.　 One becomes perceptive through purity</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-10a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.831Z">How to know that purity?</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-10a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.831Z">.　 Remain composed throughout life</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-10a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.831Z">Able to speak little,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-10a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.831Z">18　I can unify 【 】 myself,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-10a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.831Z">.　 This is called minor achievement</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-11a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.831Z">It is said:</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-11a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.831Z">What the hundred clans value is only the ruler,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-11a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.831Z">What the ruler values is only the heart,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-11a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.832Z">.　 What the heart values is only unity</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-11a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.832Z">Attain it and understand it,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-11a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.832Z">28　Above 【 】 be a guest to Heaven,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-11a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.832Z">.　 Below spread to the abyss</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-11a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.832Z">Sit and ponder it,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-11a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.832Z">Plan for a thousand lǐ;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-11a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.832Z">Rise and apply it,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-11a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.832Z">.　 Extend to the four seas</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-12a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.832Z">It is heard:</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-12a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.832Z">Reach genuine feeling and know,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-12a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.832Z">15　 【 】Examine knowledge and become spiritual,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-12a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.832Z">Examine spirituality and become unified,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-12a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.832Z">Examine unity and become complete,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-12a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.832Z">Examine completeness and become perplexed,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-12a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.832Z">.　 Examine perplexity and return</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-12a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.832Z">Hence, the old becomes new,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-12a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.832Z">People die and again become people,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-12a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.832Z">24.　Water returns 【 】 to Heaven</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-13a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.832Z">All things do not die, like the moon,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-13a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.833Z">Emerges then sometimes sets,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-13a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.833Z">Ends then sometimes begins,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-13a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.833Z">.　 Arrives then sometimes reverses</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-13a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.833Z">Examine these words,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-13a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.833Z">.25　Start from one end 【 】</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-14a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.833Z">It is heard:</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-14a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.833Z">One gives birth to two,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-14a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.833Z">Two gives birth to three,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-14a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.833Z">Three gives birth to multiplicity,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-14a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.833Z">.　 Multiplicity forms knots</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-14a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.833Z">Therefore, with one,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-14a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.833Z">Under heaven, there is nothing not having;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-14a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.833Z">Without one,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-14a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.833Z">.　 Under heaven, there is also not one having</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-14a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.833Z">21　Without 【 】 [eyes?] yet knowing names,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-14a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.833Z">.　 Without ears yet hearing sounds</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-15a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.833Z">Plants and trees obtain it to live,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-15a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.833Z">.　 Birds and beasts obtain it to cry</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-15a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.833Z">13A　Far as the arrow 【 】 to Heaven,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-15a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.833Z">Near as the arrow to man,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-15a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.833Z">12B　Therefore 【 】 examine the Dào,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-15a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.833Z">To cultivate the self</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-15a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.834Z">.　 And govern state and family</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-16a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.834Z">It is heard:</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-16a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.834Z">Able to examine one,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-16a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.834Z">Then the hundred things are not lost;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-16a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.834Z">If unable to examine one,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-16a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.834Z">22.　Then 【 】 the hundred things are all lost</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-16a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.834Z">If wishing to examine one,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-16a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.834Z">Look up and observe it,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-16a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.834Z">Look down and measure it,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-16a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.834Z">Do not seek measures afar,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-16a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.834Z">.　 Investigate it within the body</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-17a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.834Z">Attain one</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-17a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.834Z">23　 [And] 【 】 plan with it,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-17a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.834Z">As if uniting all under heaven</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-17a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.834Z">And supporting it;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-17a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.834Z">Attain one</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-17a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.834Z">And ponder it,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-17a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.834Z">As if uniting all under heaven</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-17a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.834Z">.　 And governing it</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-17a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.834Z">Hold fast to one</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-17a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.834Z">.17　Considering it the essence of Heaven and Earth 【 】</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-18a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.834Z">Therefore, one</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-18a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.834Z">Chewed has flavor,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-18a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.835Z">Smelled [has scent],</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-18a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.835Z">Struck has sound,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-18a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.835Z">Approached can be seen,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-18a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.835Z">Handled can be held,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-18a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.835Z">Grasped, it is lost,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-18a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.835Z">19　Destroyed, it becomes 【 】 withered,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-18a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.835Z">.　 Harmed, it perishes</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-18a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.835Z">Examine these words,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#KR2p0071_tls_001-18a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-25T01:52:15.835Z">.　 Start from one end</seg>
  </p>
